<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Avgold says 18 now dead from seismic event.</title>
<headline>Avgold says 18 now dead from seismic event.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African gold mining house Avgold Ltd said on Saturday that the death toll following a seismic event at its Hartebeestfontein mine last Monday had reached 18.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that three bodies were found late on Friday and another early on Saturday morning.</p>
<p>Monday's large seismic event occurred at the mine's No 4 A shaft area at a depth below surface of about 2,170 metres, causing severe damage to underground excavations.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27-11 482-1003</p>
